  "prefLabel": "Mtec 302.06 Legal Address",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mtec 302.06 Legal Address. Whenever a registrant is required to furnish his or her address by statute or rule, he or she shall provide both a physical address and, if applicable, a mailing address.\n\nSource. #11091-B, eff 5-5-16; ss by #12710, eff 1-11-19",
